# Build-context hygiene: exclude macOS/editor cruft and non-deterministic
# bytecode from the Docker build context (docker build sends the whole
# `diskimage/` directory to the daemon). A stray .DS_Store would otherwise be
# COPY'd into the guest image and skew the build.sh content fingerprint
# between macOS and Linux working trees.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/
*.swp